[{"title":"义门晓行","author":"李先芳","text":"曙色起林鸦，青天明晓霞。\n蒹葭晞白露，墟里带清沙。\n老骥长途怯，新鸿一字斜。\n不知时序晚，野菊有黄花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何明府邀宴荆山","author":"李先芳","text":"名山堪载酒，驿使暂停车。\n斜日长淮水，春风一县花。\n平崖喧立马，深树点归鸦。\n更坐莓苔上，残尊照落霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日山庄","author":"李先芳","text":"得归仍喜故园春，日日花前倒葛巾。\n自惜年光催短鬓，平分春色与东邻。\n啭枝黄鸟争歌妓，拖雨绯桃似醉人。\n华发青山莫相笑，初衣会见出风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云津送袁生之京","author":"李先芳","text":"曲水平桥江岸斜，云津门外送仙槎。\n离亭握手愁将夕，远道逢春鬓易华。\n二月行人折杨柳，一年心事问桃花。\n兰桡泊处东风遍，细雨楼台燕子家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6514,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春初过山庄","author":"李先芳","text":"山人本性爱山居，弭节春游过草庐。\n短砌雨余芳草合，小亭风定落花初。\n拂尘下榻惊梁燕，开箧抽书走壁鱼。\n更辟岩扉频洒扫，能无长者命巾车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋钓鱼台宴集兼赠倪若谷秘书得中字","author":"李先芳","text":"古寺凉蝉嘒晚风，钓鱼台近濯龙宫。\n波摇树色浮天上，山写秋容入镜中。\n莲社旧游花落尽，濠梁乐事鸟啼空。\n临流不醉新丰酒，笑杀沧浪把钓翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题栖禅寺","author":"佘翔","text":"片片归林鸟，微微出寺钟。\n僧门掩秋色，明月挂高松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6517,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情","author":"李先芳","text":"月宇开天镜，高楼试晚妆。\n秋风吹桂树，双燕语雕梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6518,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江雨","author":"李先芳","text":"西山带雨痕，南浦生秋草。\n烟中树若荠，波上舟如鸟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6519,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日登楼作","author":"李先芳","text":"长堤芳草初青，古庙垂杨几树。\n登楼不见山村，知在杏花深处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行即事","author":"李先芳","text":"城南黄叶逐人飞，城上寒鸦噪晚饥。\n老树荒村停落照，遥遥山寺一僧归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"由商丘入永城途中作","author":"李先芳","text":"三月轻风麦浪生，黄河岸上晚波平。\n村原处处垂杨柳，一路青青到永城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小亭即事","author":"李先芳","text":"绿杨垂穗噪新鸦，竹里茅亭一径斜。\n不是山人携酒至，小园闲杀碧桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春望","author":"李先芳","text":"芳草萋迷一径斜，澹烟疏雨噪新鸦。\n城南春色浓于酒，醉杀千林桃杏花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双沟夜雨","author":"李先芳","text":"风雨萧萧入暮天，孤村黄叶锁寒烟。\n官衙儿女应相说，今夜羁栖何处边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6525,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石城乐","author":"李先芳","text":"石城城下接隋堤，绿树红楼桃叶溪。\n到日江头劳借问，莫愁家在画桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6526,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋西郊杂兴","author":"李先芳","text":"因看木槿落花稀，更惜年光似鸟飞。\n斗酒黄鸡堪共乐，青山无恙故人非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6527,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遗兴呈宋山人","author":"李先芳","text":"落魄金门老岁星，归来调笑眼双青。\n高楼坐拥如花妾，月下弹筝倚醉听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6528,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"李先芳","text":"玳瑁琵琶缀玉环，为囊盛裹绣双鸾。\n自从学得朝元曲，不对君王不敢弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6529,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮酒","author":"李同芳","text":"山扉悄无事，家酿复新香。\n迟尔二三子，陶然醑一觞。\n论心爱丘壑，炙背阅年光。\n雪积冰难解，冬残日乍长。\n岁时鸟过目，身世雁随阳。\n多谢高阳伴，同来入醉乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6530,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春词二首 其一","author":"李同芳","text":"常年二月已清明，今年清明三月中。\n寄语寻春携酒客，桃花虽歇有东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6531,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春词二首 其二","author":"李同芳","text":"十千沽酒冶游郎，日指桃林是醉乡。\n花下停车莺语乱，蹊边拾翠燕泥香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6532,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟艳歌行","author":"李同芳","text":"越女秦筝手自调，阿欢按节奏金铙。\n当筵忽漫冰弦断，笑倩怀中取凤胶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答寄俞仲蔚 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"太乙贶汉德，名驹生渥洼。\n赤汗沾青云，长嘶振流沙。\n饥龁玉山刍，渴则饮其涯。\n翘尾以踯躅，騊駼相经过。\n不愿游阊阖，况乃服盐车。\n世岂无伯乐，垂耳奈我何。\n天子发素书，使者出蹉跎。\n駪駪十二闲，驽马常苦多。\n虽有千里姿，羁绊非所加。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集开元寺","author":"李攀龙","text":"流阴拂层岑，返照翳深谷。\n古寺入萧条，回岩抱幽独。\n梵影净香台，钟声殷石屋。\n绝壁栖禅诵，悬厓下樵牧。\n秋花雨还瘦，老树霜逾秃。\n寒泉可瑩心，白云况极目。\n登临客自佳，摇落时何速。\n蔬色荡腥膻，苔光清简牍。\n新诗发神秀，旧游耿初服。\n归来杖屦便，老去烟霞伏。\n高城出睥睨，灯火通林麓。\n言旋转多兴，后期此同宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同皇甫缮部寒夜城南咏月","author":"李攀龙","text":"片月挂遥岑，层城曳素阴。\n寒分宫树净，影落御沟深。\n结冷悲征笛，匀霜上捣砧。\n西园芳宴后，白雪复谁吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得屏风","author":"李攀龙","text":"虚屏汉宫里，有女《白头吟》。\n色倚琉璃怯，秋来湘水深。\n欢情张画烛，愁坐掩清砧。\n莫为苍蝇误，君王在上林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送皇甫别驾往开州","author":"李攀龙","text":"衔杯昨日夏云过，愁向燕山送玉珂。\n吴下诗名诸弟少，天涯宦迹左迁多。\n人家夜雨黎阳树，客渡秋风瓠子河。\n自有吕虔刀可赠，开州别驾岂蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中有忆江南梅花者因以为赋","author":"李攀龙","text":"欲问梅花上苑迟，座中南客重相思。\n开帘署有青山色，对酒人如白雪枝。\n驿使书来春不见，仙郎梦断月应知。\n偏惊直北多烽火，昨夜关山笛里吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀子相","author":"李攀龙","text":"蓟门秋杪送仙槎，此日开樽转岁华。\n卧病山中生桂树，怀人江上落梅花。\n春来鸿雁书千里，夜色楼台雪万家。\n南粤东吴还独往，应怜薄宦滞天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张驾部宅梅花","author":"李攀龙","text":"仙郎雪后建章回，清夜西堂拥上才。\n笛里春愁燕塞满，梁间月色汉宫来。\n即看芳树催颜鬓，莫厌寒花对酒杯。\n共忆故人江北望，因君赋罢倚徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上朱大司空 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"河堤使者大司空，无领中丞节制同。\n转饷千年军国壮，朝宗万里帝图雄。\n春流无恙桃花水，秋色依然瓠子宫。\n太史但裁《沟洫志》，丈人何减汉臣风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6542,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"按察李公诞子公蜀人先以中书舍人为御史","author":"李攀龙","text":"高才染翰五云中，复道登车揽辔同。\n雏有一毛殊是凤，驹无千里不为骢。\n名乌业已承家学，字犬文堪命国工。\n君自蜀人杨马在，同乡奕叶播清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6543,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜度娘","author":"李攀龙","text":"侬来星始集，侬去月将夕。\n不是地上霜，无人见侬迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6544,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄登宗秀才茂登池亭 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"窗中采莲舟，落日菱歌起。\n坐见浣沙人，红颜照秋水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6545,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏呈子坤 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"家有秦台女，青云路不遥。\n但愁明月夜，天上唤吹箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6546,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏呈子坤 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"丹灶几时开，妆成倚镜台。\n不须嗔窃药，本自月中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6547,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝思见过林亭 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"五柳阴阴逼酒清，一杯须见故人情。\n明朝马上听黄鸟，不似樽前唤友声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6548,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早夏示殿卿 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"长夏园林黄鸟来，百花春酒复新开。\n主人把酒听黄鸟，黄鸟一声酒一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6549,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早夏示殿卿 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"湖上青山绕屋斜，萧条重枉使君车。\n到来纵遣柴门闭，只在东邻卖酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6550,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽杨生 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"平生裘马最翩翩，不惜黄金结少年。\n今日萧条君不见，白杨秋色有谁怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6551,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘润父（已下出遗集）","author":"李攀龙","text":"摇落荒山道，君行日独深。\n解装迎暮雨，秣马发秋林。\n僮仆知乡泪，风尘见客心。\n十年悲未遇，归卧㟙湖阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6552,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄许殿卿","author":"李攀龙","text":"漠漠雨如沙，翩翩燕子斜。\n官贫轻逆旅，乡远重携家。\n昨夜怀人去，春风抚岁华。\n独行临御水，问使到梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6553,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五夜谢山人同李明府见过得宵字","author":"李攀龙","text":"客有山中约，人来江上遥。\n张灯传彩笔，换酒出金貂。\n贫病看交好，文章慰寂寥。\n天涯还此会，留醉驻春宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6554,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重别李户曹","author":"李攀龙","text":"旧游京陌满，何处珥貂行。\n念子从王事，令人识宦情。\n春风吹远别，芳草送孤征。\n莫叹谋身拙，前贤重请缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6555,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"李攀龙","text":"岂敢欹芳树，多时信转蓬。\n乡心生夜雨，客病卧秋风。\n大药三山外，浮名四海中。\n自知成汗漫，还与众人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6556,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊游","author":"李攀龙","text":"何为驱车马，终岁惨尘颜。\n偶出城西寺，因看湖上山。\n水流芳草外，人醉落花间。\n复值岩耕客，春风荷筱还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6557,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东门行 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"出东门，不顾归。\n来入门，怆欲悲。\n舍中无儋石储，还视身上衣参差。\n慷慨出门去，儿女牵裾啼。\n他家自愿富贵，贱妾与君但餔糜。\n但餔糜，上用穹窿天故，下用匍匐小儿。\n时吏清廉法不可干，一旦缓急当告谁。\n行吾望君归，嗟少年，莫轻非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6558,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陌上桑","author":"李攀龙","text":"日出东南隅，照我西北楼。\n楼上有好女，自名秦罗敷。\n罗敷贵家子，足不踰门枢。\n性颇喜蚕作，采桑南陌头。\n上枝结笼系，下枝挂笼钩。\n堕髻何缭绕，颜色以敷愉。\n缃绮为下裙，紫绮为上襦。\n行者见罗敷，下担故绸缪。\n少年见罗敷，袒裼出臂韝。\n樵者忘其薪，刍者忘其刍。\n来归但怨怒，且复坐斯须。\n使君自南来，驻我五马车。\n遣吏前致问，为是谁家姝。\n罗敷小家女，秦氏有高楼。\n西邻焦仲卿，兰芝对道隅。\n罗敷年几何，十五为人妇。\n嫁复一年馀，力桑以作苦。\n孰与使君俱，使君复为谁。\n蚕桑所自娱，小吏无所畏。\n使君一何迂。\n罗敷他人妇，使君他人夫。\n东方千馀骑，夫婿在上头。\n左右三河长，负弩为先驱。\n何用识夫婿，飞盖随高车。\n象牙为车轸，桂树为轮舆。\n白马为上襄，两骖皆骊驹。\n青丝为马靷，黄金为辔头。\n腰中千金剑，自名为鹿卢。\n起家府小吏，拜为朝大夫。\n稍迁郡太守，出入专城居。\n月朔朝京师，观者盈路衢。\n为人既白晰，鬑鬑有髭须。\n四十尚不足，三十尚有馀。\n坐中数千人，皆言夫婿殊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6559,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"宗臣","text":"一枕何能得，长愁至不禁。\n鱼龙残夜笛，风雨急秋砧。\n天入萧森气，人兼去住心。\n湖南有新雁，作意送悲音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6560,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜沈二丈至二首 其一","author":"宗臣","text":"榻有何人下，君能此夜过。\n寒蝉吴客赋，衰凤楚狂歌。\n雨气千江入，秋声万木多。\n明朝寒浦望，摇落有渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜顾二丈来集二首 其一","author":"宗臣","text":"少别已残暑，相看失旧容。\n秋衣下风露，夕草乱芙蓉。\n世故尊前尽，乡愁雨后重。\n徘徊望北斗，明月照千峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除前钱惟重夜至","author":"宗臣","text":"朔雪千门拥骑过，西风摇落罢鸣珂。\n愁边鸿雁中原去，眼底龙蛇畏路多。\n关塞岂无胡马策，江湖真负楚渔歌。\n衣裳岁暮吾将换，好与青山长薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴八首 其八","author":"宗臣","text":"司马提兵夜渡河，羽林诸将拥雕戈。\n青山一战残鼙鼓，落日千家泣绮罗。\n盗贼似闻能汉语，东南何地不夷歌。\n浮生转觉江湖窄，难把衣裳任芰荷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行","author":"宗臣","text":"并马出春城，摇鞭一相语。\n杨柳遍西湖，应从何处去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁忆弟子培","author":"宗臣","text":"秋雨千峰散，寒云万里开。\n不知天际雁，几日故园来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄卢次楩","author":"王世贞","text":"大伾山头花满烟，春来竟日酒垆眠。\n不知妻子关何事，乞取囊中卖赋钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀 其三","author":"梁有誉","text":"夕霁凉气发，曲房蔼馀清。\n金风被兰茝，白露浩已盈。\n密林谢阳彩，丛薄陨芳荣。\n迅商无缓调，征鸿怀苦声。\n物候既易感，神理固难名。\n汉阴甘灌园，鹿门事躬耕。\n金张逐丹毂，王贡彯华缨。\n由来事不同，各以性自营。\n伊予秉微尚，恬旷谐夙情。\n柱下明守雌，漆园持达生。\n缅怀昔人训，烦嚣祇自惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6568,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄司马青泛轩","author":"梁有誉","text":"达人慕恬寂，开轩负西郭。\n芊绵引蕙田，逶迤通菌阁。\n积芳集隆墀，耽胜控遥壑。\n蕊气通幽洞，湖光耿华薄。\n青桐带露疏，翠羽冲花落。\n蜃月镜疏棂，鹏云冠虚幕。\n真筌一以契，琴书聊尔托。\n鹤性在烟霞，凤想存寥廓。\n即此愿深栖，陋彼郊居作。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6569,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游白云寺","author":"梁有誉","text":"崇岫控越徼，巍镇峙郊甸。\n崒嵂亿劫馀，迢递百里见。\n疏岭何岑峭，阳林郁蓊茜。\n峻拟玄天平，俯阚海日炫。\n化城依层颠，拂策陟遥岘。\n逢槎旧术迷，遭石新磴转。\n始至岚阴豁，暂息崖光显。\n露翳若木茎，风堕昙花片。\n鸟啼谷互答，竹亚露犹泫。\n冲襟挹恬寂，素想协游衍。\n静惟迦叶智，默溯龙树辨。\n十喻总归空，六尘原不眩。\n清朝意蕊凋，缟夜心莲现。\n岁月纷递驰，栋宇几迁变。\n鹤往台草荒，龙去井泉浅。\n刻桷鼯鼠啼，雕梁蛛网罥。\n感物置安排，看云悟舒捲。\n结桂绪方遥，攀萝情莫展。\n景协赏为美，虑澹机自遣。\n愿总尘外辔，谢此区中恋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀 其一","author":"梁有誉","text":"心星转坤维，芳荣遽销谢。\n玄蝉号树间，蟋蟀吟幽榭。\n商飙荡陵苕，物性随时化。\n瞻彼孤飞鸿，游戏清澜下。\n霜霰既以违，唼藻何雍暇。\n微禽尚有适，而我独悲咤。\n志士惜流光，哀歌达长夜。\n愧无鲁阳德，何以回羲驾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀 其二","author":"梁有誉","text":"明月鉴重帏，凉风吹绮疏。\n佳人扬清讴，顾影伤离居。\n昔别黄鸟鸣，倏忽秋兰舒。\n繁华不再至，欢乐宁倩馀。\n迢迢牵牛星，万古恒不渝。\n所思杳天末，日夕增烦吁。\n秦女善鸣筝，赵女亦吹竽。\n筝竽岂不哀，不如琴瑟娱。\n织缣常苦迟，织素常苦劬。\n嗟哉织作勤，泪下沾罗襦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀 其五","author":"梁有誉","text":"阮生叹广武，陶子咏荆轲。\n岂知达士怀，感慨更繁多。\n饮酣匪甘放，身窭匪术疏。\n冥鸿游四海，所畏在虞罗。\n高车与驷马，不如南山阿。\n时议徒纷纭，其如圭璋何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀 其七","author":"梁有誉","text":"汉武伐匈奴，军声蜚八垓。\n遂令鸡鹿塞，万里无尘埃。\n汉道岂不盛，胡运有兴衰。\n当其中叶时，雄略亦摧颓。\n李广恒数奇，失落空徘徊。\n马邑竟无成，东市弃王恢。\n李陵负英风，仗剑单于台。\n饮血苦百战，悲风从天来。\n志欲吞狼望，轻谋贻祸胎。\n一旦陇族沉，徒兴壮士哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀 其九","author":"梁有誉","text":"烛龙腾遐辉，离照亘天衢。\n室隙受馀光，徒能耀一隅。\n物理固殊鉴，各随贤与愚。\n楚客倒沧海，提携得明珠。\n重宝不见赏，抱价增烦纡。\n掩袂卧空谷，孰知中所须。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]